  <div id="emojiOverlay" style="position: absolute; top:0; left:0; width:100%; height:100%; display:flex; justify-content:center; align-items:center; pointer-events:none;"></div>

<h4 style="color: #4B4B4B; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem;">
  <i class="bi bi-lightbulb-fill"></i>
  Areas for Improvement & Recommendations:
</h4>
